 "<strong>This is not the official WBSC website.</strong> This temporary training site has been established to support WBSC Softball Umpires during the implementation of the 2026-2029 Umpire Mechanics Program, while WBSC transitions the training program to the My.WBSC Officials Training Academy.": "<strong>这不是 WBSC 的官方网站。</strong>这个临时培训网站的设立，是为了在 WBSC 将培训项目迁移至 My.WBSC 裁判官员培训学院期间，支持 WBSC 垒球裁判员落实 2026-2029 裁判员机制项目。",
