 "This training site is intended for WBSC-certified Softball Umpires participating in the 2026-2029 accreditation and reaccreditation cycle.": "本培训网站面向参加 2026-2029 认证与复认证周期的、经 WBSC 认证的垒球裁判员。",
 "The Program": "项目简介",
 "One connected learning system": "一个相互连通的学习体系",
 "Modern international softball moves faster than the mechanics built to officiate it once did. Sightlines shift mid-play. Batters and baserunners generate speed that compresses the time an umpire has to find the right angle, and defensive positioning has grown more varied, so plays develop in ways that reward anticipation as much as reaction.": "现代国际垒球的节奏已经快于当初为执裁它而设计的机制。比赛进行中，视线会不断变化。击球员和跑垒员产生的速度压缩了裁判员寻找正确角度的时间，而且防守站位也更加多样，使得比赛的发展既要求反应，也同样要求预判。",
 "The 2026-2029 Umpire Mechanics Program was revised to meet that reality. Every module in this pathway is built around one question umpires ask before every pitch - not only where to be, but why that position gives them the view the play requires.": "2026-2029 裁判员机制项目正是为应对这一现实而修订的。这条学习路径中的每个模块，都围绕裁判员在每次投球之前自问的一个问题：不仅是应该站在哪里，更是为什么这个位置能够提供这次比赛所需要的视野。",
 "That question runs through the whole system, but it is answered most directly in two documents.": "这个问题贯穿整个体系，但在两份文件中得到了最直接的回答。",
