 "Complete In Order": "请按顺序完成",
 "Required Learning Sequence": "必修学习顺序",
 "WBSC has reviewed and restructured its Softball Umpire Mechanics educational materials to provide a clearer, progressive learning pathway for umpires across all Regions and National Federations.": "WBSC 对垒球裁判员机制教育资料进行了审查和重新编排，为所有地区和各国家联合会的裁判员提供更清晰、循序渐进的学习路径。",
 "The framework is built around Four Connected Pillars, progressing from foundational umpiring principles and field mechanics through to advanced elite positioning philosophies and international field mechanics.": "该框架围绕“四大相互关联的支柱”构建，从基础的执裁原则和场上机制，逐步进阶到高级精英站位理念和国际水平的场上机制。",
