 "WBSC recognises that many National Federations already have well-established and comprehensive foundational umpire training programs. The revised framework is not intended to replace these programs or their existing educational materials. Rather, it provides a common international reference that complements and supports established development pathways.": "WBSC 认识到，许多国家联合会已经拥有完善而全面的基础裁判员培训项目。修订后的框架并非要取代这些项目或其现有的教育资料，而是提供一个共同的国际参考，对已有的发展路径起到补充和支持作用。",
