 "Start Assessment": "开始评估",
 "Confirms comprehension of one-umpire starting positions and coverage.": "检验对一人制起始位置和负责范围的理解。",
 "Applies one-umpire mechanics to realistic scenarios.": "将一人制机制应用于真实场景。",
 "Confirms comprehension of the two-umpire system's three basic principles.": "检验对两人制体系三项基本原则的理解。",
 "Applies two-umpire mechanics to realistic scenarios.": "将两人制机制应用于真实场景。",
 "Confirms comprehension of the Four Essential Elements and three-umpire coverage.": "检验对四大基本要素和三人制负责范围的理解。",
 "Applies three-umpire mechanics to realistic scenarios.": "将三人制机制应用于真实场景。",
